    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/d9018ab33662bb1fb534d176e53250eb.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ok, so basically you are a fragile grandma who gets hurt by very tiny little bumps. You would like to try out this game to get a hold of your very own retirement life, and yeah, cure your ADHD before you reach your 70s so you will be patient enough to wait for a red light before crossing the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/1e96396f57fbed510b5e5605104d672a.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the Game Offers:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fragile grandma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm checkpoints so you won\u2019t break your keyboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different buttons to control your movements in order to simulate harder life in your 70s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cure for ADHD so you would be able to watch movies instead videos under 1 min</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/e7378194b176b05c6a6e6bcd2f8e13f8.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/d9018ab33662bb1fb534d176e53250eb.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ok, so basically you are a fragile grandma who gets hurt by very tiny little bumps. You would like to try out this game to get a hold of your very own retirement life, and yeah, cure your ADHD before you reach your 70s so you will be patient enough to wait for a red light before crossing the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/1e96396f57fbed510b5e5605104d672a.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the Game Offers:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fragile grandma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm checkpoints so you won\u2019t break your keyboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different buttons to control your movements in order to simulate harder life in your 70s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cure for ADHD so you would be able to watch movies instead videos under 1 min</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511870/extras/e7378194b176b05c6a6e6bcd2f8e13f8.avif?t=1739986209\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p>",
